ogin":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte-ci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-04-17T01:20:13Z","label":{"name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2811432922","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/26859#issuecomment-2811432922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/26859","id":2811432922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc6nkw_a","user":{"login":"myang2021","id":79478033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDc4MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79478033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021","html_url":"https://github.com/myang2021","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-17T01:24:34Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T01:24:34Z","body":"I debugged the issue and found that it is caused by recent commit:\n\n```\ncommit 620938b506fedba07e0cb7ac7df8078cd70a86df\nAuthor: Minghui Yang <myang@yugabyte.com>\nDate:   Sat Apr 5 00:34:03 2025 +0000\n\n    [#26645] YSQL: Preserve enum sortorder during backup\n```\n\nThe offending code is:\n\n```\n        if (isnan(yb_binary_upgrade_next_pg_enum_sortorder))\n            ereport(ERROR,\n                    (errcode(ERRCODE_INVALID_PARAMETER_VALUE),\n                     errmsg(\"pg_enum sortorder value not set when in binary upgrade mode\")));\n\n```\n\nIf a backup was generated by ysql_dump prior to the above commit, it would not have emitted a query such as\n`SELECT pg_catalog.yb_binary_upgrade_set_next_pg_enum_sortorder('2'::real);\n`  to set the enum sortorder. As a result the above ERROR causes the restore to fail.\n\nWe should change ERROR to WARNING so that we do not fail the restore because of this.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2811432922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"myang2021","id":79478033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDc4MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79478033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021","html_url":"https://github.com/myang2021","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/f